#. ~ Description of monster "Chaco chachalaca"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
msgid ""
"Though its face looks oddly like a chicken's, complete with red wattle, this "
"tan bird sounds nothing like one as it lets out raucous cries of 'chata-ra-"
"ta.'"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_bird.json
