#. ~ Description of monster "gar"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A fish belonging to the Lepisosteidae family.  These enormous fishes can be "
"found from North America to the Caribbean and are well known for their "
"prehistoric appearance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "discus"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_fish.json
msgid ""
"A round and colorful genus of fish native to the Amazon river basin.  Very "
"popular in aquariums but expensive to maintain in captivity."
msgstr ""

