#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The American crocodile, found from the Orinoco up to southernmost Florida.  "
"It's well adapted to thrive in both fresh and salty waters and can get very "
"large."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "caiman"
#: data/mods/TropiCataclysm/monsters/tropical_reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A smaller relative of the alligator which can be found all around Central and"
